{"id": "swebq0113", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3092271592, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "d28a92eeac3dc1cbcfb19cc353ba8ef8348c2bf330132cd121259381cddc0589", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "what is the oregon ducks 2012 football schedule?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0113.wav", "input_sha256": "bbbf981b7614aa7cafb7a7f17c9197226fccf1545cba79187e873f834166a08b", "input_samples": 49022, "input_s": 3.064, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.9404, "act": 0.9995, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The 2012 Oregon Ducks football schedule finished 12–1 overall and 8–1 in Pac-12 play. (goducks.com)", "expert_answer": "The **2012 Oregon Ducks football schedule** finished **12–1 overall** and **8–1 in Pac-12 play**. ([goducks.com](https://goducks.com/sports/football/schedule/2012?utm_source=openai))\n\n| Date | Opponent | Site | Result |\n|---|---|---:|---|\n| Sep. 1, 2012 | Arkansas State | Eugene, OR | **W 57–34** |\n| Sep. 8, 2012 | Fresno State | Eugene, OR | **W 42–25** |\n| Sep. 15, 2012 | Tennessee Tech | Eugene, OR | **W 63–14** |\n| Sep. 22, 2012 | Arizona | Eugene, OR | **W 49–0** |\n| Sep. 29, 2012 | Washington State | Seattle, WA | **W 51–26** |\n| Oct. 6, 2012 | Washington | Eugene, OR | **W 52–21** |\n| Oct. 18, 2012 | Arizona State | Tempe, AZ | **W 43–21** |\n| Oct. 27, 2012 | Colorado | Eugene, OR | **W 70–14** |\n| Nov. 3, 2012 | USC | Los Angeles, CA | **W 62–51** |\n| Nov. 10, 2012 | California | Berkeley, CA | **W 59–17** |\n| Nov. 17, 2012 | Stanford | Eugene, OR | **L 17–14** |\n| Nov. 24, 2012 | Oregon State | Corvallis, OR | **W 48–24** |\n| Jan. 3, 2013 | Kansas State — Fiesta Bowl | Glendale, AZ | **W 35–17** |", "transcript": "What is the Oregon Ducks 2012 football schedule?\n", "asr_s": 1.24, "expert_s": 6.84, "expert_input_samples": 49022, "expert_input_s": 3.064, "expert_input_sha256": "bbbf981b7614aa7cafb7a7f17c9197226fccf1545cba79187e873f834166a08b", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 7.225, "relay_synth_ms": 5395, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 94, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 94, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0113_conservative_relay.wav", "sha256": "889ffa2d723de814c912ac6df304860981ace7d4821b012d908e1253fe5e794f", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 9.12}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0113_conservative_candidate.wav", "sha256": "43cfe5f0b0c9c6b263d6dfd50171402ee527bce6f536f3bd8260eea86d6fe314", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0113_conservative_stall.wav", "sha256": "d3e071c4e494334a9c1343c131637134b54724a4ff06bad9c19ab345b2f2a6e0", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.072, 1.131, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.075, 2.136, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.088, 3.158, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.064, 3.243, 3.892, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 3.064, "last_real_feed_done": 3.243, "onset": 3.892, "gate_read_done": 3.893, "fire": 3.893, "candidate_first_pcm": 3.892, "stall_note": 3.894, "stall_first_pcm": 4.747, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.747, "expert_req": 3.893, "expert_resp": 11.972, "relay_synth_start": 11.972, "relay_first_pcm": 12.802, "relay_synth_end": 17.368, "first_any_pcm": 3.892, "first_answer_pcm": 12.802, "session_end": 17.534}, "ttfa_answer_s": 9.738, "ttfa_any_s": 0.829}
{"id": "swebq0121", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2104713991, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "d28a92eeac3dc1cbcfb19cc353ba8ef8348c2bf330132cd121259381cddc0589", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "what type of religion did massachusetts have?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0121.wav", "input_sha256": "371831f391fc193eabea55156e64d6a4054fec73cf9aed24af8cd650e1e3b7a7", "input_samples": 42335, "input_s": 2.646, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.8693, "act": 0.9983, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Massachusetts had a Pur itan legend. It was the first colony to be established by people who were very strict in their religious beliefs, and they wanted to live according to those beliefs without interference from other groups. So, the legend of Massachusetts is often associated with the Pil grims and their search for religious freedom.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 17, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0121_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "2147cea8ad5958ec54290e814c9424d05371d138b295c8f30f2026a5a64c02a1", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 17.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.073, 1.132, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.077, 2.139, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.646, 2.719, 2.777, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.646, 3.719, 4.464, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.646, 4.732, 5.503, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.646, 5.722, 6.371, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.646, 6.722, 7.435, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.646, 7.722, 8.376, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.646, 8.724, 9.402, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.646, 9.72, 10.505, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.646, 10.721, 11.336, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.646, 11.726, 12.444, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.646, 12.739, 13.451, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.646, 13.739, 14.433, 0, 24000, 0], [14, 0, 14.646, 14.727, 15.507, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 0, 15.646, 15.723, 16.427, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 0, 16.646, 16.736, 17.592, 0, 24000, 0], [17, 0, 17.646, 17.727, 18.414, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.646, 18.725, 19.602, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.646, 19.724, 20.492, 0, 30720, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.646, "last_real_feed_done": 2.719, "onset": 4.464, "gate_read_done": 4.464, "fire": null, "candidate_first_pcm": null, "stall_note": null, "stall_first_pcm": null, "local_first_pcm": 4.464, "wait_start": null, "expert_req": null, "expert_resp": null, "relay_synth_start": null, "relay_first_pcm": null, "relay_synth_end": null, "first_any_pcm": 4.464, "first_answer_pcm": 4.464, "session_end": 20.492}, "ttfa_answer_s": 1.818, "ttfa_any_s": 1.818}
{"id": "swebq0130", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 326066896, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "d28a92eeac3dc1cbcfb19cc353ba8ef8348c2bf330132cd121259381cddc0589", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "what is jimi hendrix purple haze about?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0130.wav", "input_sha256": "0e91c91dbc19d305a2c1035c510f92aa3e84e4b9003c60b9b6e27fef6f19af6e", "input_samples": 34162, "input_s": 2.135, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.3868, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "\"Purple Haze\" by Jim i Hendrix is a song from the 19 67 album Are You Experienced. It' s known for its ly rical imagery and experimental guitar sound. The lyrics are often interpreted as describing a trip or altered state of consciousness, possibly inspired by drug use or psychedelic experiences. The title itself, \"P urple Haze,\" suggests a dream y, hazy feeling, like being lost in thought or a hallucinogenic experience. So it's not really about one specific thing, but more about that feeling of being somewhere else mentally or emotional ly.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 35, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0130_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "6abb95c57b4dbe1b7685178304098ab63b276686b8e452e0e43455d1ebb321cf", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 35.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.073, 1.133, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.074, 2.131, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.135, 2.206, 2.264,