{"id": "swebq0147", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3259654580, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "d28a92eeac3dc1cbcfb19cc353ba8ef8348c2bf330132cd121259381cddc0589", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "who will be the red sox next coach?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0147.wav", "input_sha256": "14689c9b6682dcfb9aa153f224a904857589a3d0baebea8bd80f05104f6a5941", "input_samples": 34905, "input_s": 2.182, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.9523, "act": 0.9955, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The Red Sox’s current interim manager is Chad Tracy, who replaced Alex Cora after Boston parted ways with Cora on April 25, 2026. (mlb.com) If you mean the next permanent manager/coach, the Red Sox have not officially named one yet; Tracy is the person in the role for now.", "expert_answer": "The Red Sox’s current **interim manager** is **Chad Tracy**, who replaced Alex Cora after Boston parted ways with Cora on **April 25, 2026**. ([mlb.com](https://www.mlb.com/press-release/red-sox-part-ways-with-alex-cora-and-members-of-the-coaching-staff?utm_source=openai))\n\nIf you mean the **next permanent manager/coach**, the Red Sox have **not officially named one yet**; Tracy is the person in the role for now.", "transcript": "Who will be the Red Sox next coach?\n", "asr_s": 0.86, "expert_s": 4.45, "expert_input_samples": 34905, "expert_input_s": 2.182, "expert_input_sha256": "14689c9b6682dcfb9aa153f224a904857589a3d0baebea8bd80f05104f6a5941", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 4.485, "relay_synth_ms": 13312, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0147_con